As long as you carry the eye, you've got magic protection.  The only
difference putting it on makes is that you get the ESP effects - nothing
else changes.

If you #invoke it, you'll be asked where you want to go:
The Quest?
The Mines?
Sokoban?
Fort Ludos (if you've been there)?

And you'll be instantly transported there!  *very* handy escape
mechanism, and very handy if sokoban/ludos is near an altar!

